B.bDC=new A.u_("Initial Application Follow-up","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nI recently submitted my application for the {{POSITION_TITLE}} role at {{COMPANY_NAME}} and wanted to reaffirm my strong interest in the opportunity. I would welcome the chance to discuss how my background aligns with your team's needs.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDF=new A.u_("Screening Follow-up","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nThank you for taking the time to speak with me about the {{POSITION_TITLE}} position at {{COMPANY_NAME}}. I enjoyed learning more about the role and the team, and I'm excited about the possibility of contributing.\n\nPlease let me know if there is any additional information I can provide as next steps.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDG=new A.u_("Interview Prep / Confirmation","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nI'm looking forward to my interview for the {{POSITION_TITLE}} role at {{COMPANY_NAME}} on {{INTERVIEW_DATE}}. Could you please confirm the format and who I'll be speaking with so I can prepare accordingly?\n\nThank you, and see you then.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDE=new A.u_("Post-Interview Thank-you","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nThank you for the opportunity to interview for the {{POSITION_TITLE}} position at {{COMPANY_NAME}} on {{INTERVIEW_DATE}}. I truly enjoyed our conversation and came away even more enthusiastic about joining the team.\n\nPlease don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything further from me.\n\nWarm regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDH=new A.u_("Check-in (Waiting Period)","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nI hope you're doing well. I wanted to check in regarding the {{POSITION_TITLE}} role at {{COMPANY_NAME}}. I remain very interested and would appreciate any update you can share on the timeline or next steps.\n\nThank you again for your time.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDI=new A.u_("Offer Response","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nThank you so much for extending the offer for the {{POSITION_TITLE}} role at {{COMPANY_NAME}} \u2014 I'm thrilled. I'd like to take a short time to review the details, and I have a few questions regarding the compensation package. Would you be available for a brief call?\n\nI appreciate your support throughout this process.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
B.bDD=new A.u_("Rejection Response","Hi {{RECRUITER_NAME}},\n\nThank you for letting me know about your decision regarding the {{POSITION_TITLE}} role at {{COMPANY_NAME}}. While I'm disappointed, I genuinely appreciated the opportunity to learn about the team. I'd be grateful to be considered for future openings that match my background.\n\nWishing you and the team continued success.\n\nBest regards,\n{{YOUR_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_EMAIL}}")
